            <text>&lt;style&gt;
        ol {
            list-style-type: disc;
            margin-top: 1 em;
            margin-left: 0;
            margin-right: 0;
            padding-left: 40px;
        }

        p {
            margin-top: 1 em;
            margin-left: 0;
            margin-right: 0;
        }
    &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Configure Sync Filter for granular and fine grained control for workload sync.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CMDB Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt; Conditions to evaluate fields from source table (defined by &lt;strong&gt;Class Mapping&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Label Conditions:&lt;/strong&gt; Conditions to evaluate labels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extent:&lt;/strong&gt; Specify Filter Criteria to match against &lt;strong&gt;Known to PCE&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Enforcement Mode&lt;/strong&gt; fields.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An active Sync Filter will be considered as &lt;strong&gt;Empty&lt;/strong&gt; and will be skipped when:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No &lt;strong&gt;CMDB Conditions&lt;/strong&gt; are specified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No &lt;strong&gt;Label&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Conditions&lt;/strong&gt; are specified&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No &lt;strong&gt;Extent&lt;/strong&gt; is specified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preview of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Label&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Conditions&lt;/strong&gt; is only updated after the changes are saved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifying any of the above make an active Sync Filter eligible during Auto Sync.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some notes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manual Singular or Multiple Sync/Delete does not consider Sync Filters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Label&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Conditions&lt;/strong&gt; must strictly be formed only using &lt;strong&gt;Illumio Label Dimension&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;CMDB Value&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;IS&lt;/strong&gt; operator only.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Each set of a single&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Illumio Label Dimension&lt;/strong&gt; and one or more (to match multiple values against a label) &lt;strong&gt;CMDB&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is considered as one term and is evaluated independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sync Filter selects the workloads that match all three (whichever is &lt;strong&gt;Non Empty&lt;/strong&gt;), i.e. Label Condition, CMDB Condition &amp;amp; Extent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Matching Workloads&lt;/strong&gt; do not consider conflicts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Once saturation is attained (number of workloads considered eligible by all processed Sync Filters becomes equal to total number of non-duplicate workloads), succeeding Sync Filters will be skipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;When multiple PCE Configurations exist, a PCE Configuration filter should be applied to &lt;strong&gt;Illumio Label Dimension&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;picker. Saving with a &lt;strong&gt;Illumio Label Dimension&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;outside of current PCE Configuration is not allowed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
